    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Free signup\nThe signup form on the site POSTs here.\n\n**Nobody pays anything in this flow.** It creates the row, welcomes the seller, and tells you a new person joined.\n\nThe seller's own WhatsApp message (from the site button) is what opens the 24-hour window that lets these plain-text replies through.",
